   "text": "Yes, the voided hold is the one that should drop off. Its status is \"voided,\" so the bank has released it and it isn't a charge. The record says it should come off your statement within 1 to 3 business days. Your bank's timing can vary a little, but that's the usual window.\n\nYour only real charge is the settled $33.67 from 6:47 PM. If the hold is still showing after 3 business days, contact me and I'll check the record again."
